---
description: Guardrails for all agent work in this repo
alwaysApply: true
---
- inventory-service/ is read-only. Never create, edit or delete files there.
- Work only on approved items in the current tasks.md. Keep diffs small and
  explain every changed file.
- Use synthetic data only. No secrets, tokens or real guest data in code,
  logs or fixtures.
- Business rules (capacity, overbooking policy) live only in reservation-service.
  Never duplicate them in other modules, scripts or the agent.
- Ask before running destructive commands or adding any new dependency.
- Never delete or weaken an existing test to make it pass.
